sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant M as RegistrationModal
    participant H as useRegisterChallenge
    participant RS as registrationService
    participant PS as paymentService
    participant E1 as edge create-razorpay-order
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant RZP as Razorpay
    participant E2 as edge verify-razorpay-payment

    U->>M: pick ticket, submit
    M->>H: mutate(args)
    H->>RS: registerForChallenge(args)
    RS->>PS: createRazorpayOrder
    PS->>E1: POST challenge_id, ticket_id, JWT
    E1->>E1: getClaims(jwt) -> userId
    E1->>DB: SELECT price_inr FROM challenge_tickets
    E1->>RZP: POST /v1/orders (server-trusted amount)
    RZP-->>E1: order_id, amount, currency
    E1->>DB: INSERT orders (status created)
    E1-->>PS: order_id, key_id, amount
    PS-->>RS: order
    RS-->>M: open Razorpay Checkout
    U->>RZP: pay via Checkout
    RZP-->>M: razorpay_payment_id + signature
    M->>PS: verifyRazorpayPayment(...)
    PS->>E2: POST signature
    E2->>E2: HMAC verify (needs audit)
    E2->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=paid
    E2->>DB: INSERT registrations (status active)
    Note over RZP,E2: MISSING - razorpay-webhook for async payment.failed / refund.processed
